  "scales": "Bytes are bar heights 0-100 on the unit's own meter screen (firmware tables Tin 0x1f8ca0, Tout 0x1f8d08, Thd 0x1f8e40). Ticks: input 0/-3/-7/-10/-15/-20/-40 dBFS and output +3/0/-3/-7/-10 dB at the unit's screen heights; gain reduction 4 per dB (0-25 dB); Comp 1.25 % per step; HD output 0..-12 dB is inferred (no screen shows its labels). Groups follow the unit's own meter screen: five-band In, AGC, Multiband, Out, Comp; two-band In, AGC, 2 Band, HF (0 to -6 dB), Out, PWR (0 to -10 dB), C (virtual 8400, 21 October 2026). HD output meters (bytes 28-29) are not shown: the unit shows them only with system IBOC METER set to HD, which is not verified."
